# NOTE: `webapp` must STAY in the context — the server image builds and serves
# the SPA (webapp/dist is excluded by `dist` above; only source is needed).
# NOTE: `packages` (workspace deps @highlights/*) must stay in the context —
# the server image COPYs the whole monorepo and needs them for npm ci.
*.log
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
# Runtime data/artifact mounts (ADAAAA-6694). These live on the box as container
# volume mounts (see the deploy skill) — they must NOT be baked into any image.
# Including docker/data (44G), docker/models* (35G) and docker/runs (4G) in the
# `COPY . .` context blew the box disk during a server rebuild ("no space left
# on device") and made every image build transfer tens of GB. Excluding them
# keeps images small and the deploy fast. Runtime content still mounts in.
docker/data
docker/data-smoke
docker/models
docker/models-ad6695
docker/runs
docker/lpdata-orch
docker/signer-data
